%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as React SPA
    participant BFF as Node.js BFF
    participant WS as WebSocket /ws
    participant MaaS as MaaS Gateway
    participant Model as AI Model
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant K8s as K8s API

    Browser->>BFF: GET /api/config
    BFF-->>Browser: models, users, rateLimits

    Browser->>WS: connect
    WS-->>Browser: config event

    Browser->>WS: start_traffic (pattern, rate)

    loop Traffic Generation
        BFF->>MaaS: POST /v1/chat/completions
        MaaS->>Model: inference (body-based routing)
        Model-->>MaaS: completion response
        MaaS-->>BFF: response (or 429 rate limited)
        BFF->>WS: request_start → request_complete
        WS-->>Browser: animate particle on topology
    end

    loop Every 5s
        BFF->>Prom: PromQL (vLLM metrics)
        Prom-->>BFF: queue depth, KV cache, p95 latency
        BFF->>WS: model_status event
        WS-->>Browser: update model node color/stats
    end

    Note over BFF,K8s: Subscription Watcher (K8s Watch API)
    BFF->>K8s: Watch MaaSSubscriptions
    loop On MaaSSubscription change
        K8s-->>BFF: MODIFIED event (new token limits)
        BFF->>WS: rate_limit_update
        WS-->>Browser: update user rate limit display
    end
